  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "`VRChat 2026.3.3 - October 2 - Build 1919 - Live`\n\nWhen I am speaking to someone, I need to make eye contact, and have the \"HUD\" mic icon be within my peripheral vision.\n\nThis has to be within a certain degree of angle for me to easily see, without darting my eyeballs.\n\nNow it is further out (more lower and more left) than before. My eyes hurt.\n\nPut it back, or let me move it.\n\nThis new update is obviously a stylistic rebrand, but they have actually sacrificed accessibility for it. This is just bad. Such a Microslop move.",
